Sing out loud

26
00:01:15,845 --> 00:01:18,135
Happily strolling together

27
00:01:18,289 --> 00:01:19,522
Doraemon

28
00:01:19,589 --> 00:01:21,529
Let this moment never grow old

29
00:01:21,582 --> 00:01:28,915
Beautiful scenery can finally be seen

30
00:01:31,535 --> 00:01:34,192
[Nap in Heaven]

31
00:01:41,418 --> 00:01:42,885
What’s all the noise about?

32
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:45,155
Mom!

33
00:01:45,295 --> 00:01:48,062
The neighbors have started construction work.

34
00:01:48,149 --> 00:01:50,237
Ah, it’s really noisy!

35
00:01:50,556 --> 00:01:52,256
I guess I’ll just go to Shizuka’s house.

36
00:01:53,458 --> 00:01:54,898
Why is it like this?

37
00:01:54,939 --> 00:01:57,104
The neighbors bought a new sound system.

38
00:01:57,145 --> 00:01:59,265
They turn it up really loud every morning.

39
00:02:00,010 --> 00:02:01,272
There’s nothing we can do.

40
00:02:01,352 --> 00:02:02,932
Let’s go to the open lot to escape.

41
00:02:05,404 --> 00:02:06,357
Still noisy.

42
00:02:06,398 --> 00:02:07,517
Nope.

43
00:02:08,183 --> 00:02:10,057
We are recyclers

44
00:02:10,157 --> 00:02:12,857
Bicycles, computers...

45
00:02:13,278 --> 00:02:15,245
Selling bamboo

46
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:18,151
-Japan is really very noisy
-Drying rack bamboo

47
00:02:18,192 --> 00:02:21,441
-I want to go to a quiet country
-Selling bamboo

48
00:02:24,512 --> 00:02:26,665
Got it, Doraemon

49
00:02:26,705 --> 00:02:28,825
Doesn't your magic bag have cloud-condense spray?

50
00:02:28,866 --> 00:02:29,718
Huh?

51
00:02:29,885 --> 00:02:32,392
Let's use it to sleep in the clouds!

52
00:02:32,432 --> 00:02:34,006
Oh, so that's it?

53
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,633
Which cloud is better?

54
00:02:35,674 --> 00:02:37,453
That big one is good

55
00:02:38,838 --> 00:02:40,876
"Cloud Condensing Mist"

56
00:02:45,804 --> 00:02:47,692
It should have solidified by now

57
00:02:49,102 --> 00:02:51,217
Okay, no problem

58
00:02:56,565 --> 00:02:59,052
Big and quiet, it's great!

59
00:02:59,197 --> 00:03:01,097
Yeah, wait a moment

60
00:03:01,603 --> 00:03:04,516
It would be a pain if the wind blew the cloud away

61
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:11,962
We will be over this area

62
00:03:12,871 --> 00:03:14,751
Shizuka

63
00:03:17,549 --> 00:03:18,943
What is it, Nobita?

64
00:03:18,983 --> 00:03:20,569
Shall we go up to the clouds?

65
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,095
Hurry up...

66
00:03:32,709 --> 00:03:35,116
Welcome, Shizuka

67
00:03:38,592 --> 00:03:40,505
This is so much fun

68
00:04:07,897 --> 00:04:09,764
Let's climb the cloud hills

69
00:04:20,269 --> 00:04:22,829
We can't play like this on the ground

70
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,967
Ah, so comfortable

71
00:04:29,008 --> 00:04:30,760
It's so quiet here too

72
00:04:30,801 --> 00:04:32,747
It's simply like heaven

73
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:34,795
Heaven?

74
00:04:35,375 --> 00:04:37,855
Right, make it into a real heaven!

75
00:04:37,896 --> 00:04:39,874
What is a real heaven like?

76
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,747
Build a beautiful pool near here

77
00:04:43,788 --> 00:04:44,840
Got it!

78
00:04:46,490 --> 00:04:48,525
"Floating gas"

79
00:04:53,163 --> 00:04:55,372
Build a temple on the mountaintop

80
00:04:56,156 --> 00:04:58,684
"Automatic multi-purpose engineering machine"

81
00:04:59,290 --> 00:05:00,659
After putting in the design plans

82
00:05:00,699 --> 00:05:03,038
it will be built according to the design plans

83
00:05:22,463 --> 00:05:23,908
Amazing

84
00:05:25,136 --> 00:05:26,443
That's right

85
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,591
To create some atmosphere...

86
00:05:29,884 --> 00:05:31,017
I found it

87
00:05:31,058 --> 00:05:32,834
It's the costume from last year's play

88
00:05:33,021 --> 00:05:34,907
To live happily in heaven

89
00:05:35,307 --> 00:05:37,612
We need to bring lots of snacks and drinks

90
00:05:40,025 --> 00:05:41,072
I'm back

91
00:05:41,113 --> 00:05:42,425
It's done already

92
00:05:47,356 --> 00:05:48,649
Amazing

93
00:05:48,802 --> 00:05:50,128
Nobita

94
00:05:51,899 --> 00:05:53,239
How's this look?

95
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,543
Amazing, like a real angel

96
00:05:55,584 --> 00:05:57,323
Then add one more thing

97
00:05:57,535 --> 00:05:59,795
"Automatic Rainbow Maker"

98
00:06:05,104 --> 00:06:06,711
Even the sparrows have flown here

99
00:06:06,752 --> 00:06:08,884
No matter how you look at it, it's paradise

100
00:06:23,687 --> 00:06:25,775
This feeling is so good

101
00:06:36,259 --> 00:06:38,285
Look at that cloud, it's so strange

102
00:06:38,345 --> 00:06:39,639
It's really strange

103
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,439
It can stay still for hours

104
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,945
That's strange, what's happening?

105
00:06:45,092 --> 00:06:46,792
It's really strange

106
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:47,800
Alright

107
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,933
I'll use this ball to test it

108
00:06:53,846 --> 00:06:55,346
Who is it?

109
00:06:58,134 --> 00:07:00,082
It's Gian and Suneo!

110
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:01,429
Outrageous

111
00:07:01,636 --> 00:07:03,109
Back to you!

112
00:07:05,488 --> 00:07:06,362
Ouch

113
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,393
Catch me if you can!

114
00:07:12,521 --> 00:07:14,828
Nobita, how dare you be so arrogant

115
00:07:14,869 --> 00:07:17,104
The rocket is ready to launch

116
00:07:17,145 --> 00:07:18,839
Three, two, one…

117
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:19,811
Launch!

118
00:07:25,142 --> 00:07:26,222
Success!

119
00:07:27,451 --> 00:07:29,791
Nobita, you jerk, watch this!

120
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,101
Not that easy

121
00:07:35,313 --> 00:07:36,990
Alright, since it's like this

122
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:42,515
He actually threw balls at us from the clouds

123
00:07:43,543 --> 00:07:46,130
After throwing them, he wouldn't let us go up either

124
00:07:46,170 --> 00:07:47,477
This way of thinking, where as long as you're happy

125
00:07:47,518 --> 00:07:50,304
You don't care about others' feelings, is wrong

126
00:07:50,619 --> 00:07:52,173
Nobita!

127
00:07:53,299 --> 00:07:55,090
Come down right now!

128
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,307
Mom

129
00:07:58,348 --> 00:08:00,180
It seems Mom is very angry

130
00:08:00,248 --> 00:08:01,561
It doesn't really matter anyway

131
00:08:01,602 --> 00:08:03,081
Because we've already played enough

132
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:04,814
That's true, isn't it?

133
00:08:06,181 --> 00:08:07,427
Nobita

134
00:08:07,668 --> 00:08:10,296
You hogged the cloud all to yourself, that's too selfish!

135
00:08:10,337 --> 00:08:11,123
Doraemon

136
00:08:11,164 --> 00:08:13,857
Hurry up and lend us the Anywhere Door so we can go play up there!

137
00:08:13,898 --> 00:08:15,731
Got it, got it

138
00:08:22,707 --> 00:08:23,753
Awesome

139
00:08:23,794 --> 00:08:25,841
There's a swimming pool and a house too

140
00:08:25,907 --> 00:08:28,120
That's right, it's called the Sky-House

141
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,235
This house belongs to us now

142
00:08:30,276 --> 00:08:32,613
This is outrageous! Don't you know you're causing trouble for people?

143
00:08:32,654 --> 00:08:34,606
It's gonna be cloudy all the time like this!

144
00:08:34,983 --> 00:08:36,856
My clothes have been hung all day and still aren't dry

145
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:39,029
Excuse me, please move that cloud away immediately

146
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,161
You idiots!

147
00:08:52,448 --> 00:08:54,648
[Dictator Button]

148
00:09:04,232 --> 00:09:05,840
18 to 2

149
00:09:05,947 --> 00:09:07,379
It's a crushing defeat

150
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:09,388
This time we lost by 18 points

151
00:09:09,461 --> 00:09:12,155
15 of those points were because of your mistakes, Nobita!

152
00:09:12,382 --> 00:09:15,363
18 points minus 15 points is...

153
00:09:15,404 --> 00:09:16,163
three

154
00:09:16,204 --> 00:09:18,110
So, even if I didn't score those 15 points,

155
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,783
we still lost by three to two

156
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:22,062
It wasn't because of me that we lost, really!

157
00:09:22,103 --> 00:09:23,289
Shut up!

158
00:09:23,506 --> 00:09:24,886
If it weren't for your mistakes,

159
00:09:24,926 --> 00:09:26,529
we could have scored at least five more points

160
00:09:26,570 --> 00:09:28,462
So, in total, we lost 20 points

161
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:31,637
It all comes down to you that we lost

162
00:09:31,684 --> 00:09:33,021
Is that so?

163
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:35,134
Let me retrain you

164
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,806
The first training is for me to hit a thousand balls to you

165
00:09:37,966 --> 00:09:40,200
Okay, but I have something to do...

166
00:09:40,266 --> 00:09:41,441
Don't go!

167
00:09:42,266 --> 00:09:43,796
Don't go...

168
00:09:44,095 --> 00:09:46,130
Nobita, don't you want to improve?

169
00:09:46,336 --> 00:09:49,374
I really want to improve, but I don't like practicing

170
00:09:59,662 --> 00:10:00,864
This is terrifying!

171
00:10:02,869 --> 00:10:04,382
So mean!

172
00:10:04,465 --> 00:10:07,238
Why does Gian do this to me all the time?

173
00:10:07,372 --> 00:10:10,327
In the end, it's because you're too bad at playing.

174
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:12,533
I'll go with you.

175
00:10:12,574 --> 00:10:15,214
To stop being treated like this, go practice.

176
00:10:15,314 --> 00:10:15,959
Let's go!

177
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,882
No!

178
00:10:18,357 --> 00:10:20,508
The problem now is with Gian.

179
00:10:20,881 --> 00:10:21,888
That's right.

180
00:10:21,929 --> 00:10:24,602
If only Gian didn't exist, this wouldn't happen.

181
00:10:26,053 --> 00:10:29,166
Actually, it's simple. If Gian moved away, it would be fine

182
00:10:30,011 --> 00:10:31,605
You really think that?

183
00:10:31,957 --> 00:10:34,504
That's just a fact, he just needs to go

184
00:10:34,545 --> 00:10:35,928
Then try this

185
00:10:37,601 --> 00:10:39,567
"Dictator Button"

186
00:10:40,155 --> 00:10:41,188
Dictator?

187
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:44,888
This is a button manufactured at the request of a future
dictator

188
00:10:45,405 --> 00:10:47,151
The so-called dictator is like this

189
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:48,688
They want to make the whole world follow

190
00:10:48,729 --> 00:10:51,708
their own ideas and develop according to their tastes.

191
00:10:51,890 --> 00:10:54,760
What would they do if other people had different ideas?

192
00:10:55,019 --> 00:10:56,120
They would be eliminated.

193
00:10:56,339 --> 00:10:58,088
In order to realize their own ideals,

194
00:10:58,128 --> 00:10:59,147
they would use this button

195
00:10:59,188 --> 00:11:02,567
to eliminate one by one the people who oppose them and hinder them.

196
00:11:04,377 --> 00:11:06,297
Eliminate? What does that mean?

197
00:11:06,344 --> 00:11:09,242
They would disappear from the world, without a trace.

198
00:11:09,722 --> 00:11:11,102
Oh, that came just in time.

199
00:11:11,678 --> 00:11:12,488
Watch

200
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:15,959
What? What?

201
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,840
The fly is really gone

202
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,799
Isn't it simple?

203
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,701
Eliminate the eyesore person!

204
00:11:22,713 --> 00:11:25,763
Use it to change the world as you wish

205
00:11:26,766 --> 00:11:29,720
But I think it's terrifying to eliminate people

206
00:11:30,253 --> 00:11:32,176
Let me consider it first

207
00:11:32,608 --> 00:11:35,216
Suit yourself, take your time to consider

208
00:11:36,872 --> 00:11:39,372
Although Gian is an annoying person

209
00:11:39,604 --> 00:11:42,744
it's too shameful to eliminate him

210
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:47,800
That hurts!

211
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,939
Who is it?

212
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:50,112
It is I, your lord!

213
00:11:50,225 --> 00:11:51,907
You just ran away!

214
00:11:51,948 --> 00:11:54,114
If you don't want me to pitch to you,

215
00:11:54,207 --> 00:11:56,148
Then I'll just hit you directly.

216
00:11:57,294 --> 00:11:58,280
Don't run away!

217
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,560
Please spare me!

218
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,756
If that's the case,

219
00:12:00,810 --> 00:12:03,823
-I'd rather go practice. 
- What?! Shut up!

220
00:12:05,993 --> 00:12:07,325
Don't go!

221
00:12:07,599 --> 00:12:09,598
Nobita, get ready to be beaten!

222
00:12:09,731 --> 00:12:10,704
G... Gian

223
00:12:10,745 --> 00:12:11,898
The first blow

224
00:12:12,004 --> 00:12:13,107
Disappear!

225
00:12:29,003 --> 00:12:30,103
He disappeared?

226
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:32,760
He really disappeared

227
00:12:35,543 --> 00:12:37,689
I've done something very serious

228
00:12:39,997 --> 00:12:41,137
Is that Nobita?

229
00:12:42,470 --> 00:12:44,549
What are you doing? Your face is pale

230
00:12:44,590 --> 00:12:46,582
I've eliminated Gian... what should I do?

231
00:12:46,623 --> 00:12:48,102
I've eliminated Gian.

232
00:12:48,143 --> 00:12:50,262
Who's Gian? Who is that?

233
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:54,070
I'm said Gian, so Gian, Takeshi Goda.

234
00:12:54,110 --> 00:12:56,450
He's huge and always bullying people.

235
00:12:56,491 --> 00:12:58,864
He's a classmate who lives nearby.

236
00:12:59,236 --> 00:13:01,166
Is there really someone like that?

237
00:13:01,207 --> 00:13:03,750
Shizuka, you've had headaches because of him too.

238
00:13:03,833 --> 00:13:07,370
My name is Gian, I'm the little overlord.

239
00:13:07,417 --> 00:13:09,144
Strong and tough.

240
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:10,150
Like that?

241
00:13:10,516 --> 00:13:12,079
That song is quite interesting

242
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,246
No way

243
00:13:13,672 --> 00:13:15,372
Just in time

244
00:13:15,507 --> 00:13:16,953
Teacher...

245
00:13:17,579 --> 00:13:18,651
What are you doing, Nobita?

246
00:13:18,692 --> 00:13:19,473
Teacher, you...

247
00:13:19,513 --> 00:13:21,412
You should know a person named Gian, right?

248
00:13:21,453 --> 00:13:22,427
Gian?

249
00:13:22,784 --> 00:13:25,671
It seems like there's no one like that in our class.

250
00:13:25,712 --> 00:13:28,345
So far, there are no students with that name.

251
00:13:28,386 --> 00:13:29,672
How can that be?

252
00:13:29,732 --> 00:13:31,419
Shizuka, come with me.

253
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,632
Little G!

254
00:13:41,044 --> 00:13:42,530
Nobita, what's wrong?

255
00:13:43,210 --> 00:13:46,165
We want to ask about your brother.

256
00:13:46,206 --> 00:13:48,300
My brother? Go ahead and ask.

257
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:51,319
That's great, the sibling relationship hasn't changed.

258
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:53,085
This is my brother.

259
00:13:55,377 --> 00:13:58,710
So this is what your brother is like in your mind, Little G.

260
00:13:59,362 --> 00:14:02,316
He is a good person, very stylish, and best at playing the flute.

261
00:14:02,365 --> 00:14:04,510
It would be great to have a brother like that.

262
00:14:04,664 --> 00:14:06,750
How could it be like this?

263
00:14:07,287 --> 00:14:09,067
Your brother is rough.

264
00:14:10,067 --> 00:14:11,830
He looks like this.

265
00:14:11,944 --> 00:14:13,424
Skilled at eating and drinking excessively.

266
00:14:15,322 --> 00:14:16,582
You've gone too far!

267
00:14:18,730 --> 00:14:19,883
Nobita!

268
00:14:19,924 --> 00:14:21,537
I'm sorry, it was fake...

269
00:14:21,578 --> 00:14:22,684
I was just kidding.

270
00:14:26,386 --> 00:14:27,941
Rather than saying he disappeared

271
00:14:27,982 --> 00:14:29,941
Better to say he never existed in the first place

272
00:14:36,896 --> 00:14:37,831
Nobita

273
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:41,211
If you make another mistake, you'll be in trouble

274
00:14:41,990 --> 00:14:43,004
Got it!

275
00:14:46,589 --> 00:14:48,504
You have to hit it!

276
00:14:49,829 --> 00:14:52,312
Ball is good, batter out!

277
00:14:53,217 --> 00:14:55,292
It really wasn't my fault

278
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:02,517
Who is it?

279
00:15:02,558 --> 00:15:03,331
It's me

280
00:15:03,384 --> 00:15:04,615
Suneo?

281
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:07,614
Nobita, you made us lose today's game.

282
00:15:08,689 --> 00:15:10,516
In a world without Gian...

283
00:15:10,556 --> 00:15:12,049
Suneo is the leader?

284
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:12,935
As punishment,

285
00:15:12,975 --> 00:15:15,828
I'm going to hit a thousand balls to you.

286
00:15:15,869 --> 00:15:18,959
If you don't want to catch them, I'll come and hit you!

287
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,859
It's exactly the same.

288
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:22,185
Here I come!

289
00:15:23,733 --> 00:15:25,700
I hate it when this happens!

290
00:15:26,177 --> 00:15:28,458
Stop talking! First strike!

291
00:15:28,580 --> 00:15:30,197
Suneo disappear!

292
00:15:32,211 --> 00:15:32,811
Hey

293
00:15:33,552 --> 00:15:34,469
Suneo

294
00:15:36,283 --> 00:15:37,543
It's like this again?

295
00:15:37,623 --> 00:15:39,356
It's not my fault

296
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,480
I won't use it again

297
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:43,319
I have to give it back to Doraemon quickly

298
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,719
Hey, Nobita

299
00:15:44,792 --> 00:15:47,574
Today's game was lost because of you

300
00:15:47,702 --> 00:15:49,122
Don't go too far.

301
00:15:49,163 --> 00:15:50,749
Watch out, or I'll get rid of you!

302
00:15:52,339 --> 00:15:53,899
Each and every one of you is like this.

303
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,518
Nobita

304
00:15:55,660 --> 00:15:58,106
You didn't do your homework, where did you go to play?

305
00:15:58,147 --> 00:16:00,332
Mom, I beg you, don't make me angry!

306
00:16:01,565 --> 00:16:04,640
You want me to make Gian and Suneo, who disappeared, reappear?

307
00:16:04,708 --> 00:16:06,095
It can't be done.

308
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:08,788
This isn't a magic show.

309
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:10,227
How can that be?

310
00:16:10,268 --> 00:16:11,540
Forget them.

311
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:15,708
This button is scary.

312
00:16:15,748 --> 00:16:17,728
When I get angry, I naturally want to press it.

313
00:16:17,768 --> 00:16:18,847
I don't care anymore!

314
00:16:35,391 --> 00:16:37,838
Nobita is really useless.

315
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:40,371
This boy is really infuriating.

316
00:16:40,828 --> 00:16:42,622
-Nobita is good at nothing
-Nobita is good at nothing

317
00:16:42,663 --> 00:16:44,028
-and a scaredy-cat.
-and a scaredy-cat.

318
00:16:44,149 --> 00:16:45,056
Stop...

319
00:16:45,104 --> 00:16:46,929
I really don't want to press the button anymore.

320
00:16:47,044 --> 00:16:48,770
But with annoying things all disappeared

321
00:16:48,811 --> 00:16:50,595
Wouldn't you be happy?

322
00:16:50,636 --> 00:16:51,328
No!

323
00:16:51,369 --> 00:16:52,371
Always lying!

324
00:16:53,829 --> 00:16:55,306
Even Doraemon is like this

325
00:16:55,346 --> 00:16:57,772
Stop it, you guys are ganging up on me!

326
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,972
I'm going to destroy all of you!

327
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:10,021
It's so strangely quiet?

328
00:17:10,607 --> 00:17:11,966
Mom!

329
00:17:12,172 --> 00:17:13,565
Doraemon!

330
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,027
Mom!

331
00:17:17,905 --> 00:17:18,972
Mom!

332
00:17:23,858 --> 00:17:26,631
Always scolding me for not turning off the faucet, but you do the same thing?

333
00:17:30,752 --> 00:17:31,976
There's no one here?

334
00:17:32,293 --> 00:17:34,495
Everyone must have gone to the open lot to play

335
00:17:34,536 --> 00:17:35,467
That's right!

336
00:17:35,508 --> 00:17:37,769
Hey, let me join you!

337
00:17:42,859 --> 00:17:45,039
Shizuka, let's play together!

338
00:17:45,079 --> 00:17:46,322
Shizuka!

339
00:17:46,515 --> 00:17:48,214
Shizuka, hey!

340
00:17:48,254 --> 00:17:49,774
If you're here, then answer me!

341
00:17:49,815 --> 00:17:51,345
Hey, come out!

342
00:17:51,910 --> 00:17:53,970
Hello...

343
00:17:54,011 --> 00:17:56,050
Hello, is anyone there?

344
00:17:56,376 --> 00:17:57,896
Is anyone there?

345
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:00,173
Hello, is anyone there?

346
00:18:04,035 --> 00:18:05,382
Oh right, find Dad

347
00:18:12,686 --> 00:18:14,404
Why aren't you picking up the phone?

348
00:18:16,927 --> 00:18:18,321
I can't see even a single person?

349
00:18:19,769 --> 00:18:20,832
Here too

350
00:18:21,945 --> 00:18:23,951
Here too, here too

351
00:18:23,992 --> 00:18:25,245
What should I do?

352
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:29,217
I made everyone in the world eliminated.

353
00:18:29,263 --> 00:18:31,306
This is a big problem!

354
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:43,467
So what?

355
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:46,360
What's done is done.

356
00:18:47,227 --> 00:18:49,100
Always look on the bright side of things.

357
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:51,298
I no longer have friends who look down on me.

358
00:18:51,339 --> 00:18:53,654
Nor do I have my mother and teacher to bother me.

359
00:18:53,819 --> 00:18:54,752
So from now on

360
00:18:54,792 --> 00:18:56,908
I can do whatever, whenever, and wherever I want.

361
00:18:56,958 --> 00:18:58,025
Alright!

362
00:18:58,690 --> 00:19:01,219
I've wanted to try sleeping on the highway since long ago.

363
00:19:01,852 --> 00:19:04,072
This place will be called Nobita Station from now on.

364
00:19:04,565 --> 00:19:06,342
What a magnificent building!

365
00:19:07,278 --> 00:19:09,485
This place will be used for afternoon naps from now on!

366
00:19:11,371 --> 00:19:13,925
The entire Earth belongs to me now.

367
00:19:14,251 --> 00:19:17,324
I am the dictator, long live me!

368
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,710
All the TV stations aren't broadcasting.

369
00:19:22,751 --> 00:19:24,277
I guess I expected this.

370
00:19:26,296 --> 00:19:28,939
Now I can do anything at any time.

371
00:19:29,203 --> 00:19:31,743
But, on the other hand, there's nothing special I want to do.

372
00:19:32,210 --> 00:19:35,410
If I had known it would be like this, I would have at least left Doraemon here

373
00:19:36,579 --> 00:19:37,379
Mom!

374
00:19:42,190 --> 00:19:44,251
There should be enough money

375
00:19:45,562 --> 00:19:46,957
It looks delicious

376
00:19:52,601 --> 00:19:54,761
I can just eat what I like

377
00:19:55,348 --> 00:19:57,267
I can drink whatever I want, anytime

378
00:20:02,434 --> 00:20:04,400
Special dessert, complete!

379
00:20:16,435 --> 00:20:18,348
I can't eat anymore

380
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,427
Okay, here it comes!

381
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,820
Great, impressive!

382
00:20:31,186 --> 00:20:33,000
Actually it's not impressive at all

383
00:20:36,043 --> 00:20:37,760
Since I have nothing better to do

384
00:21:01,210 --> 00:21:03,104
Great! Did you see that?

385
00:21:03,170 --> 00:21:04,971
Doraemon said I need to practice more

386
00:21:05,011 --> 00:21:06,430
He was actually right!

387
00:21:07,827 --> 00:21:11,060
Well, now Gian and Suneo won't look down on me anymore

388
00:21:38,836 --> 00:21:40,220
I'm back

389
00:21:43,927 --> 00:21:46,413
I'm the only one whose light is on

390
00:21:51,492 --> 00:21:53,872
I'll sleep with the light on tonight

391
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:56,946
There's a power outage?

392
00:22:07,890 --> 00:22:09,665
Nobody is listening

393
00:22:10,385 --> 00:22:12,024
There is no one else here

394
00:22:21,445 --> 00:22:22,939
Come out quickly

395
00:22:23,365 --> 00:22:24,679
I don't care who it is

396
00:22:24,719 --> 00:22:27,298
I don't even mind if it's Gian

397
00:22:28,399 --> 00:22:29,906
It's just me left

398
00:22:31,487 --> 00:22:33,407
I can't survive

399
00:22:33,488 --> 00:22:35,859
Eliminating people one by one because you don't like them

400
00:22:35,899 --> 00:22:38,003
Things will end up like this

401
00:22:38,043 --> 00:22:39,318
Do you understand now?

402
00:22:39,778 --> 00:22:41,011
I understand now

403
00:22:42,987 --> 00:22:45,145
Doraemon, why are you here?

404
00:22:47,077 --> 00:22:48,737
Actually, this gadget

405
00:22:48,797 --> 00:22:51,784
was specifically invented to discipline dictators

406
00:22:52,430 --> 00:22:53,760
Restore original state

407
00:23:17,690 --> 00:23:20,710
Being a dictator is not a good thing, isn't that right?

408
00:23:22,515 --> 00:23:23,542
Mm-hmm

409
00:23:29,191 --> 00:23:31,924
Huh? An incompetent person is practicing here

410
00:23:34,765 --> 00:23:35,716
Hey!

411
00:23:35,841 --> 00:23:36,875
You have to try harder next time

412
00:23:36,916 --> 00:23:39,521
Don't make me hit you again, understand?

413
00:23:39,715 --> 00:23:42,253
It's quite fun to have people around bothering us!

414
00:23:44,569 --> 00:23:46,604
Suneo, come on, let's start.

415
00:23:46,645 --> 00:23:47,931
Oh, of course.

416
00:23:51,212 --> 00:23:53,504
Nobita, give it your all!

417
00:23:53,545 --> 00:23:54,858
No problem!

418
00:23:59,903 --> 00:24:02,343
-Good catch, Nobita!
-Good catch, Nobita!

419
00:24:02,457 --> 00:24:03,157
Okay!

420
00:24:03,198 --> 00:24:04,542
Let's go again!

421
00:24:08,601 --> 00:24:10,128
Sha la la la la.

422
00:24:10,188 --> 00:24:12,627
Sing along with me

423
00:24:12,714 --> 00:24:14,067
Singing aloudl

424
00:24:14,121 --> 00:24:16,555
Happily strolling together

425
00:24:16,734 --> 00:24:17,947
Doraemon

426
00:24:18,002 --> 00:24:19,981
Let this moment never grow old

427
00:24:20,014 --> 00:24:26,391
Beautiful scenery can be seen

